<h2 id="the-click">The Click You Did Not Know You Were Making</h2>
<p>The moment you click "Contact Agent," "Schedule a Showing," or "Request More Info" on a Zillow listing, you have identified yourself as a high-intent buyer and consented to being contacted by an agent you did not choose, from a company you did not know was in the room. That agent is not the listing agent. That agent is the one who paid the most for your zip code this month.</p>

